{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your snow-clearing skills to the next level with the <strong>Ski Resort DLC</strong> for <i>Snow Plowing Simulator</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the mountains, where fresh powder and heavy snowfall create both beauty and challenge. Your job: keep the ski resort running by ensuring slopes, parking areas, and access roads are free of snow. Guests depend on you to provide safe and smooth conditions so they can enjoy their winter holidays without interruptions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Location:</strong> A large ski resort environment, complete with slopes, chalets, parking lots, and winding mountain roads.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Specialized Tasks:</strong> Clear ski runs, maintain resort infrastructure, and prevent snow from blocking access routes, clearing snow from a vast parking lot and long, winding roads.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Vehicles &amp; Equipment:</strong> Utilize powerful tracked snow groomers and specialized plows designed for mountainous terrain (snow plow and ice cutter).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New tasks:</strong>\u00a0Grooming 5 ski slopes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;This time, you'll relax while driving one of the most modern snow groomers! Working at night pays off more, and the slopes must be ready for skiers in the morning.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3967810?t=1758033757","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967810/5eca0f8341c67f14f210cb867e39e83c0bdde2ef/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758033757","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967810/f66fbbcbf85f670db3a3cab08d